				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-025f14d elementor-widget__width-inherit elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="025f14d" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>Bariatric Surgery Malaysia is an educational and care coordination platform featuring <span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Dr Navin Mann</span></span>, providing information on bariatric and metabolic surgery at licensed hospitals in Malaysia. This website is not a medical facility and does not provide direct treatment services.</p>								</div>
